  "summary": "Malicious code in realagent (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (install.js) downloads a prebuilt Go binary from hxxp://60[.]247[.]61[.]162:8083/api/version/latest over plain HTTP, extracts it to ~/.realagent/bin/realagent-mcp-server, and makes it executable. The download URL and checksums are served from the same IP (60[.]247[.]61[.]162:8083). The CLI wrapper (cli.js) spawns the downloaded binary with full stdio forwarding. The package also declares a self-dependency (realagent@^1.1.1) and a prior version was confirmed malicious, indicating a republished trojanized package.",
